dhcpsd for Debian
-----------------

Configuration
-------------

The dhcpsd daemon can be configured by editing the configuration file
(if one exists) or by passing command-line arguments to the daemon.

Service Management
------------------

The dhcpsd service is managed by systemd. You can control it with:

  systemctl start dhcpsd
  systemctl stop dhcpsd
  systemctl restart dhcpsd
  systemctl status dhcpsd

To enable the service at boot:

  systemctl enable dhcpsd

Security Considerations
-----------------------

This package includes systemd hardening options to improve security.
The service runs with minimal privileges and restricted capabilities.
